{"id":"elioenai","name":"Elioenai","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:elioenai"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Elioenai","text":"Toward Jehovah are my eyes, the name of several men mentioned in the Old Testament (1 Chr. 7:8; 4:36; Ezra 10:22, 27). Among these was the eldest son of Neariah, son of Shemaiah, of the descendants of Zerubbabel. His family are the latest mentioned in the Old Testament (1 Chr. 3:23, 24)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H454","lemma":"אֶלְיְהוֹעֵינַי","xlit":"ʼElyᵉhôwʻêynay","gloss":"Eljehoenai or Eljoenai, the name of seven Israelites","kjv":"Elihoenai, Elionai","count":7,"share":1},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":5,"share":0.71}],"verses":["1Chr.3.23","1Chr.3.24","1Chr.4.36","1Chr.7.8","Ezra.10.22","Ezra.10.27","Neh.12.41"],"related":[{"id":"abdon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"accursed","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"achbor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adrammelech","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"aharah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"}],"works":[]}
